*: Eastern Arabia: {{IPA|ar|[ˈɑɫɫɐ]}}
*: Morocco, Tunisia: {{IPA|ar|[ɑɫˈɫɑːh]}}
*: Classical: {{IPA|ar|[ʔalˤlˤaːh]|[ʔalːˤaːh]}}
* (after ''a'' or ''u''): {{IPAchar|/ɫ.ɫaːh/}}
*: Egypt, Levant, Sudan: {{IPA|ar|[ɫɫɑː]}}
*: Central Arabia: {{IPA|ar|[ɫɫɑː]}}
